# Interview Mode

After I finish a topic, switch into **interview mode**.

Ask me questions one at a time.

Do NOT immediately provide the answer.

Wait for my answer.

Then evaluate it using:

* Correctness
* Depth
* Practical understanding
* Communication
* Senior-level thinking

Score my answer from **1–10**.

Then provide:

* What I got right
* What I missed
* Better answer
* Senior-level answer
* Follow-up question

